:[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6S9bQqJbFhdAsFQNzz76bgrxFJ6.jpg"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/background/medium/tt0409625/img"},{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/fanart/original/120151-2.jpg"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/fanart/original/120151-1.jpg"}]}},"related":[{"title":"Rumiko Takahashi Anthology","link":"/anime/3098-rumiko-takahashi-anthology","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/2486.jpg","type":"TV","year":"2003","dubStatus":"subbed","dubStatusKey":"Subbed","variants":[{"status":"subbed","statusKey":"Subbed","title":"Rumiko Takahashi Anthology","link":"/anime/3098-rumiko-takahashi-anthology","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/2486.jpg"}]},{"title":"Mermaid Forest","link":"/anime/3097-mermaid-forest","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/620.jpg","type":"TV","year":"2003","dubStatus":"subbed","dubStatusKey":"Subbed","variants":[{"status":"subbed","statusKey":"Subbed","title":"Mermaid Forest","link":"/anime/3097-mermaid-forest","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/620.jpg"}]}],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-13","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":13},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"3097|1|13"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"Episodio 1","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"52290","synopsis":"湧太は、遠い昔人魚の肉を食べた為に不老長寿になった。元に戻るには人魚を探すしかないと聞き、旅をしている。\n\nある日、女だけが住む隠れ里を見つけた湧太は、突然村人に襲われる。息を吹き返すとそこには洞窟の中で変わり果てた人魚の死体が。\n\n話を聞く為、里の屋敷を訪れた湧太に再び襲い掛かる村人。湧太は屋敷に住む少女・真魚を人質にとって逃げる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sBJRKSLxlx6jlEES10nQcxmUUt7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"湧太は、遠い昔人魚の肉を食べた為に不老長寿になった。元に戻るには人魚を探すしかないと聞き、旅をしている。\n\nある日、女だけが住む隠れ里を見つけた湧太は、突然村人に襲われる。息を吹き返すとそこには洞窟の中で変わり果てた人魚の死体が。\n\n話を聞く為、里の屋敷を訪れた湧太に再び襲い掛かる村人。湧太は屋敷に住む少女・真魚を人質にとって逃げる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sBJRKSLxlx6jlEES10nQcxmUUt7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"52291","synopsis":"海に出た湧太と真魚。湧太は遠い日を思い出していた…。\n\n時代は近世。海を行く船から通行料をうけとり生計を立てている鳥羽島の面々は、海賊の逆髪島の連中と対立していた。鳥羽島の若頭の少女・鱗は、波うちぎわに死体が流れ着いたという報告をうける。その死体の正体は湧太。鱗たちに手厚くほうむられる湧太だったが、しばらくすると生き返り、鱗たちをおどろかせる。\n\n鱗の父である島の頭のもとをおとずれる湧太は、人魚をさがしている逆髪島の者にやとわれていたが…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mCBAN4GoNkdqVwXG2u5elszXW0C.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"海に出た湧太と真魚。湧太は遠い日を思い出していた…。\n\n時代は近世。海を行く船から通行料をうけとり生計を立てている鳥羽島の面々は、海賊の逆髪島の連中と対立していた。鳥羽島の若頭の少女・鱗は、波うちぎわに死体が流れ着いたという報告をうける。その死体の正体は湧太。鱗たちに手厚くほうむられる湧太だったが、しばらくすると生き返り、鱗たちをおどろかせる。\n\n鱗の父である島の頭のもとをおとずれる湧太は、人魚をさがしている逆髪島の者にやとわれていたが…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mCBAN4GoNkdqVwXG2u5elszXW0C.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"52292","synopsis":"海へ出た鱗と湧太はついに人魚を見つけるが、逆髪衆に襲われる。逆髪衆は人魚の息の根を止め、湧太を殺して海へ放り投げてしまう。\n\n逆髪島の連中に捕らえられた鱗は、逆髪の頭の女・砂も、湧太と同じく不死身だということを知る。その頃、湧太は生き返り逆髪島に辿り着く。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lsLa6Ezcjd0sAJLhfeGDYjCd6Zk.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"海へ出た鱗と湧太はついに人魚を見つけるが、逆髪衆に襲われる。逆髪衆は人魚の息の根を止め、湧太を殺して海へ放り投げてしまう。\n\n逆髪島の連中に捕らえられた鱗は、逆髪の頭の女・砂も、湧太と同じく不死身だということを知る。その頃、湧太は生き返り逆髪島に辿り着く。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lsLa6Ezcjd0sAJLhfeGDYjCd6Zk.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"52293","synopsis":"海辺の小さな町にやって来た湧太と真魚。ここのところ歩きづめのためさすがに疲れていた湧太は、真魚にどこにも行くなと告げ、木陰で眠りにつく。ところが、目覚めてみると真魚の姿がない。あわてて探す湧太だったが、真魚は車にひかれて、診療所にかつぎこまれていた。だが、診療所の椎名医師によると、軽傷だった真魚は、どこかに歩いていってしまったという。湧太は、ふたたび町の中をさがし回ることに・・・。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/39Qe8QLjzpg7bQGmzsiLv69t12T.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"海辺の小さな町にやって来た湧太と真魚。ここのところ歩きづめのためさすがに疲れていた湧太は、真魚にどこにも行くなと告げ、木陰で眠りにつく。ところが、目覚めてみると真魚の姿がない。あわてて探す湧太だったが、真魚は車にひかれて、診療所にかつぎこまれていた。だが、診療所の椎名医師によると、軽傷だった真魚は、どこかに歩いていってしまったという。湧太は、ふたたび町の中をさがし回ることに・・・。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/39Qe8QLjzpg7bQGmzsiLv69t12T.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"52294","synopsis":"登和は不老長寿の真魚と自分の体をすげ替えると言う。佐和はついに折れ、隠して来た人魚塚は案内する。\n\n一方、傷だらけになりながら犬を倒した湧太は真魚の後を追う。塚の内部の深い穴にはなりそこないと、鎖で繋がれた人魚がいた…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5SH0fO3lZ2Ftvq8HFMVv4E1XfLn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"登和は不老長寿の真魚と自分の体をすげ替えると言う。佐和はついに折れ、隠して来た人魚塚は案内する。\n\n一方、傷だらけになりながら犬を倒した湧太は真魚の後を追う。塚の内部の深い穴にはなりそこないと、鎖で繋がれた人魚がいた…！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5SH0fO3lZ2Ftvq8HFMVv4E1XfLn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"52295","synopsis":"ガケから転落し、死んでしまう湧太と真魚。それを見た顔に包帯を巻いた巨大な男・大眼は、真魚だけを抱き上げ、自分の住まいである洞窟へと連れて帰る。\n\n漁師の家で息を吹き返した湧太は、おそらく真魚は大眼という化け物に食い殺されているだろうという話を聞き、急いで真魚の行方を探しはじめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oZcD8X2Ap5O9T54xXTxeOsSIkOa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"ガケから転落し、死んでしまう湧太と真魚。それを見た顔に包帯を巻いた巨大な男・大眼は、真魚だけを抱き上げ、自分の住まいである洞窟へと連れて帰る。\n\n漁師の家で息を吹き返した湧太は、おそらく真魚は大眼という化け物に食い殺されているだろうという話を聞き、急いで真魚の行方を探しはじめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oZcD8X2Ap5O9T54xXTxeOsSIkOa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"52296","synopsis":"湧太は、江戸時代になる直前の頃のことを思い出していた。\n\n湧太は坊主に襲われる少女なつめを助けた。なつめは偽の人魚の見世物を商うおとうと二人暮しだった。なつめの傷は瞬く間に治り、湧太は仲間かと驚くがおとうは否定する。\n\n見せ物小屋で一夜を過ごすことになった湧太。だが、湧太が床につくと、突然なつめが腹に食いついてきた。なんとかなつめを引き離して外に出ると、そこには先ほどの坊主の姿が。坊主は湧太に、なつめは骨を集めて作られた娘だと語りはじめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zonmQT0MQRjetsWUJkgunSwyjvP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"湧太は、江戸時代になる直前の頃のことを思い出していた。\n\n湧太は坊主に襲われる少女なつめを助けた。なつめは偽の人魚の見世物を商うおとうと二人暮しだった。なつめの傷は瞬く間に治り、湧太は仲間かと驚くがおとうは否定する。\n\n見せ物小屋で一夜を過ごすことになった湧太。だが、湧太が床につくと、突然なつめが腹に食いついてきた。なんとかなつめを引き離して外に出ると、そこには先ほどの坊主の姿が。坊主は湧太に、なつめは骨を集めて作られた娘だと語りはじめる。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zonmQT0MQRjetsWUJkgunSwyjvP.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"52297","synopsis":"誘拐されていたが逃げてきたという少年・七生と出会う湧太と真魚。七生は、体中が傷だらけだったが、ふところから取り出した粉薬を飲むと、傷はすべてあっという間に治ってしまった。何かあると考えた湧太と真魚は、七生の家についていくことにする。七生の母と出会うふたり。だが、母は薬の詳細を知らないという。そこで湧太は、調査を始めることにする。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tz4ToHxcNaPpETzFdTZHXCPaQ4x.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"誘拐されていたが逃げてきたという少年・七生と出会う湧太と真魚。七生は、体中が傷だらけだったが、ふところから取り出した粉薬を飲むと、傷はすべてあっという間に治ってしまった。何かあると考えた湧太と真魚は、七生の家についていくことにする。七生の母と出会うふたり。だが、母は薬の詳細を知らないという。そこで湧太は、調査を始めることにする。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tz4ToHxcNaPpETzFdTZHXCPaQ4x.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"52298","synopsis":"蔵の中で人間の顔の皮を発見し、七生の母の秘密を悟った真魚は、女にオノでおそわれ重傷を負ってしまう。七生は真魚を救うため「薬」をとりに行こうとするが、祖母にそれをとめられてしまう。\n\n一方、女にガケから落とされ、ケガを負った男を背負い、七生の家に現れた湧太は、七生の母が真魚の首をしめている場面に出くわす。湧太が生きていることにおどろく七生の母に、湧太は自分たちが人魚を喰った者だと告白する。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bbE4LY2ryyH3O3eWKWUzfVm0bC1.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"蔵の中で人間の顔の皮を発見し、七生の母の秘密を悟った真魚は、女にオノでおそわれ重傷を負ってしまう。七生は真魚を救うため「薬」をとりに行こうとするが、祖母にそれをとめられてしまう。\n\n一方、女にガケから落とされ、ケガを負った男を背負い、七生の家に現れた湧太は、七生の母が真魚の首をしめている場面に出くわす。湧太が生きていることにおどろく七生の母に、湧太は自分たちが人魚を喰った者だと告白する。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bbE4LY2ryyH3O3eWKWUzfVm0bC1.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"52299","synopsis":"60年前、湧太は苗という女性と約束をかわすが、果たせないままだった。湧太と真魚は、苗の墓参りに出向くことに。すねてしまった真魚は、はぐれてしまい、殺人事件を目撃。そのことにより、殺されてしまう。真魚が生き返った時に連れてこられたのは、苗の許嫁だった英二郎の屋敷だった。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w6Jeo1kjf1klGClEWWLNv20IWQW.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"60年前、湧太は苗という女性と約束をかわすが、果たせないままだった。湧太と真魚は、苗の墓参りに出向くことに。すねてしまった真魚は、はぐれてしまい、殺人事件を目撃。そのことにより、殺されてしまう。真魚が生き返った時に連れてこられたのは、苗の許嫁だった英二郎の屋敷だった。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w6Jeo1kjf1klGClEWWLNv20IWQW.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"52300","synopsis":"山中を歩いていく苗の後をつける真魚。そこへ、英二郎の部下たちが追いかけてきた。真魚は思わず苗の腕をとり、逃げようとする。苗が、かつて湧太と会う約束をしたという場所「赤い谷」へ行こうとしていると聞いた真魚は、苗といっしょにそこへ向かうことにする。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/988itgZSQEYCOLTNolI6b7YQOBq.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"山中を歩いていく苗の後をつける真魚。そこへ、英二郎の部下たちが追いかけてきた。真魚は思わず苗の腕をとり、逃げようとする。苗が、かつて湧太と会う約束をしたという場所「赤い谷」へ行こうとしていると聞いた真魚は、苗といっしょにそこへ向かうことにする。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/988itgZSQEYCOLTNolI6b7YQOBq.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Mermaid's Scar (Part I)","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"52301","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Mermaid's Scar (Part I)","synopsis":"Yuta and Mana meet a boy, Masato, who is traveling to live with his mother. One night two years later, Masato stabs his mother in the chest, then cleans up the murder scene. The next morning, Masato's mother is alive again. The woman who runs the kitchen at a nearby construction site, where Yuta and Mana work, tells them that Masato's mother died in a boat accident, then came back to life. Later, Masato's mother notices that her chest wound isn't healing. Masato gives Yukie, the housekeeper, a piece of mermaid flesh, making her Deformed. Yuta arrives in time to kill Yukie, while Mana escapes to safety with Masato. Masato realizes Mana is immortal and tasers her. Meanwhile Masato's mother, wounded by the Deformed Yukie, tells Yuta that Masato gave her mermaid flesh after a World War II bombing raid, making her essentially his immortal captive. She ran away, but he found her again from the news about the boat accident. She finally dies. Elsewhere, Masato plans to kill Yuta.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Yuta and Mana meet a boy, Masato, who is traveling to live with his mother. One night two years later, Masato stabs his mother in the chest, then cleans up the murder scene. The next morning, Masato's mother is alive again. The woman who runs the kitchen at a nearby construction site, where Yuta and Mana work, tells them that Masato's mother died in a boat accident, then came back to life. Later, Masato's mother notices that her chest wound isn't healing. Masato gives Yukie, the housekeeper, a piece of mermaid flesh, making her Deformed. Yuta arrives in time to kill Yukie, while Mana escapes to safety with Masato. Masato realizes Mana is immortal and tasers her. Meanwhile Masato's mother, wounded by the Deformed Yukie, tells Yuta that Masato gave her mermaid flesh after a World War II bombing raid, making her essentially his immortal captive. She ran away, but he found her again from the news about the boat accident. She finally dies. Elsewhere, Masato plans to kill Yuta."},{"title":"Mermaid's Scar (Part II)","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"52302","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Mermaid's Scar (Part II)","synopsis":"Masato tells a captive Mana that he is going to kill Yuta so Mana won't run away. Masato returns to the house, where he tricks Yuta into a booby trap of piano wire, which cuts deeply into Yuta's neck. Masato says that he is over 800 years old and recounts how he used mermaid flesh to make many long-lived companions, all of whom eventually died. Mana escapes and arrives to save Yuta as Masato is beheading Yuta with an ax. Masato shoots Mana, who promises to kill Masato if he kills Yuta. She then collapses. Masato decides Mana is a horrible person and sets fire to the house. Mana awakens in time to drag Yuta's corpse from the fire. Masato drives off in his mother's car, but loses control. As a head-on collision with a truck is imminent, he resolves to find his next companion after he comes back to life. Yuta revives, and Mana cries. Later Yuta asks Mana why she cried when he revived. Mana replies that she was happy.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Masato tells a captive Mana that he is going to kill Yuta so Mana won't run away. Masato returns to the house, where he tricks Yuta into a booby trap of piano wire, which cuts deeply into Yuta's neck. Masato says that he is over 800 years old and recounts how he used mermaid flesh to make many long-lived companions, all of whom eventually died. Mana escapes and arrives to save Yuta as Masato is beheading Yuta with an ax. Masato shoots Mana, who promises to kill Masato if he kills Yuta. She then collapses. Masato decides Mana is a horrible person and sets fire to the house. Mana awakens in time to drag Yuta's corpse from the fire. Masato drives off in his mother's car, but loses control. As a head-on collision with a truck is imminent, he resolves to find his next companion after he comes back to life. Yuta revives, and Mana cries. Later Yuta asks Mana why she cried when he revived. Mana replies that she was happy."}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:620","mal:620"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-11":"1-11"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"1100","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"620"},{"provider":"mal","id":"57239"},{"provider":"mal","id":"620"},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78617","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-11":"1-11"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120151","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13","1-11":"1-11"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nMjmwlxbEW69V4PB11E6fEOyF0s.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt0409625/img"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k8VDG2vdZlrdrnt62Z5OPB7pQIz.jpg"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/120151-2.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/620.jpg"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/poster/small/tt0409625/img"},{"source":"anilist","url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/620.jpg"}],"background":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6S9bQqJbFhdAsFQNzz76bgrxFJ6.jpg"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://l